 "coveTailTrailReason": "2026-09-27 workerD: DEF-vs-build clip sheet showed the Move body curled into a ball with the tail hanging forward while the DEF streams it straight back (same DEF animation as the stormbird). Ported the stormbird's fix: an 8-bone QTail chain along this mesh's own tail centreline (points read off a |x|<0.07 mid-slice of the smartrigged mesh, region r 0.13, body in front of y=0.02 excluded) and ext/cove_tailtrail.py with the stormbird's clip weights. Death [0.2,1.0] added after the first tail build: its sheet still curled the dying body into a ring with the tail over the back while the DEF falls stretched with the tail back (g05 f2-7). Death end weight 1.0 -> 0.75: at 1.0 the corrective-morph extent on the last death frame (Master_071) was 1.5004, just over the slice gate 1.5; the tail no longer rings at either weight.",
